-- LumiHunter AI — Demo/showroom data seed for "LumiLife Gráfica"
--
-- Purpose: recreate the demo "showroom" dataset used to present the LumiHunter
-- platform, without touching schema (no tables/columns/RLS/functions/triggers
-- are created or altered by this script — DML only).
--
-- Prerequisites (this script assumes, and does NOT create):
--   1. Exactly one company exists in public.companies: "LumiLife Gráfica"
--      with id = '6aeb0155-596e-42fe-8952-378b52dacdf7'. If your company id
--      differs, replace that UUID throughout this file before running it
--      (e.g. with `sed`).
--   2. That company already has the standard auto-seeded rows created by
--      the platform's own triggers: 9 pipeline_stages, 5 ai_agents, and a
--      subscriptions row. This script does not create those.
--   3. A demo owner user exists in auth.users / public.company_members for
--      that company (see "Demo login" below) — referenced here as
--      created_by/assignee_id = '5f72bb0f-326c-4c32-83f0-2a78a62c314f'.
--      If you don't have this exact user, replace that UUID with any
--      existing company_members.user_id for the company.
--
-- Idempotency: every insert below uses fixed UUIDs and
-- `ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING`, so re-running this script against a
-- database that already has this exact seed is a no-op (no duplicates).
-- It is NOT a general-purpose "reset" — to fully recreate the environment
-- from scratch, first delete the company's existing domain data
-- (`DELETE FROM public.leads WHERE company_id = '<id>'` cascades to
-- lead_contacts, lead_tags, activities, conversations, messages, tasks,
-- notes, campaign_targets, etc. via ON DELETE CASCADE FKs; similarly for
-- products, campaigns, icp_profiles, knowledge_entries, message_templates)
-- and then run this file.
--
-- Demo login: the demo owner account (demo@lumihunter.com / "Administrador
-- LumiLife") is NOT created by this script, since it requires inserting
-- directly into Supabase's auth.users/auth.identities with a bcrypt-hashed
-- password (via extensions.crypt(password, extensions.gen_salt('bf'))) —
-- deliberately kept out of version control. Ask the person who ran this
-- seed for the credentials, or create a fresh demo user via Supabase Auth
-- and update the created_by/assignee_id UUID above to match.
--
-- What this seeds (all fictitious data — no real people, companies, phone
-- numbers or emails):
--   - 25 products/services for LumiLife Gráfica
--   - 83 leads across all 9 pipeline stages, spread across Curitiba and
--     nearby cities, with recommended_product_ids populated per segment
--   - ~262 activities (discovery, qualification, contact history)
--   - 38 conversations and 105 messages (WhatsApp/email), purely historical
--     demo data — running this script never sends any real message
--   - 3 ICP profiles + linked products
--   - 8 knowledge base entries
--   - 4 message templates
--   - 4 campaigns + 19 campaign targets
--   - 20 tasks + 5 notes
--
-- Generated for the LumiHunter AI demo environment cleanup/seed task.

begin;

on conflict (id) do nothing;
on conflict (id) do nothing;
